#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a new signature"
msgstr "Crear unha sinatura nova"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new signature, go to <menuchoice> <shortcut> <keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu>File</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. This will create an "
"<guilabel>&lt;empty signature&gt;</guilabel> in the <guilabel>Signatures</"
"guilabel> section. <mousebutton>Left</mousebutton> click the &lt;empty "
"signature&gt; and in the bottom section type in your new signature. "
"<example> <title>Signature example</title> <screen>\n"
"Mr. Konqi\n"
"konqi@kde.org\n"
"http://www.kde.org\n"
"</screen> </example> Once you have completed your signature, save it by "
"going to <menuchoice> <shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</"
"keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>, or by pressing the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> "
"button (floppy disc icon)."
msgstr ""
"Para crear unha sinatura nova, vaia a <menuchoice> <shortcut> <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Nova</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. "
"Isto crea unha <guilabel>&lt;sinatura baleira&gt;</guilabel> na sección "
"<guilabel>Sinaturas</guilabel>. Prema co botón <mousebutton>esquerdo</"
"mousebutton> do rato &lt;sinatura baleira&gt; e, na sección de abaixo, "
"escriba a nova sinatura. <example> <title>Exemplo de sinatura</title> "
"<screen>\n"
"Mr. Konqi\n"
"konqi@kde.org\n"
"http://www.kde.org\n"
"</screen></example>Unha vez rematada a sinatura, gárdea con to <menuchoice> "
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Gravar</guimenuitem> </"
"menuchoice> ou premendo o botón <guibutton>Gravar</guibutton> (icona dun "
"disquete)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can create as many signatures as you would like. Doing so provides you "
"with a list of signatures to use in email applications such as &kmail;, so "
"no matter how informal or professional you need to be, there will always be "
"an available signature."
msgstr ""
"Pódense crear tantas sinaturas como se queira. Ao facélo conséguese unha "
"lista de sinaturas que se poden empregar nas aplicacións de correo "
"electrónico omo &kmail;, polo que, non importa o informal ou profesional que "
"se queira ser, sempre haberá unha sinatura disponíbel."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "Deleting a signature"
msgstr "Eliminarunha sinatura"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove a signature first select the signature that you want to remove and "
"then click <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Remove</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, or by clicking the <guibutton>Remove</guibutton> "
"button with the red x icon in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Para eliminar unha sinatura seleccione primeiro a sinatura que quere borrar "
"e prema <menuchoice><guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu><guimenuitem>eliminar</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> ou prema o botón <guibutton>Eliminar</guibutton>, "
"que é o que ten unha icona dun x vermello na barra de ferramentas."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding daily signatures to &kmail;"
msgstr "Engadir sinaturas diarias ao &kmail;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adding a daily signature is pretty straight forward. Open &kmail; by "
"pressing <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo>. Enter "
"<command>kmail</command> in the text box and then press <guibutton>Run</"
"guibutton>. Once inside &kmail;, go to <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure KMail...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. In the "
"<guilabel>Identities</guilabel> selection, highlight the identity to add the "
"signature to and then press the <guibutton>Modify...</guibutton> button on "
"the right-hand side of the window. Select the <guilabel>Signature</guilabel> "
"tab. Check the <guilabel>Enable signature</guilabel> box. From the "
"<guilabel>Obtain signature text from</guilabel> drop down, select "
"<guimenuitem>Output of Command</guimenuitem>. In the <guilabel>Specify "
"command</guilabel> text box, enter <command>ksig --daily</command> and then "
"press the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Engadir unha sinatura diaria é ben sinxelo. Abra o &kmail; con "
"<keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo>. Escriba <command>kmail</"
"command> no campo de texto e prema <guibutton>Executar</guibutton>. Unha vez "
"dentro do &kmail;, vaia a <menuchoice><guimenu>Configuración</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configurar KMail...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Na "
"sección <guilabel>Identidades</guilabel> resalte a identidade á que lle "
"quere engadir a sinatura e prema o botón <guibutton>Modificar...</guibutton> "
"que hai na parte dereita da xanela. Seleccione o separador "
"<guilabel>Sinatura</guilabel>. Seleccione a opción <guilabel>Activar a "
"sinatura</guilabel>. No menú despregábel <guilabel>Obter o texto da sinatura "
"de</guilabel> seleccione <guimenuitem>Saída de comando</guimenuitem>. No "
"campo de texto <guilabel>Especificar comando</guilabel> escriba "
"<command>ksig --daily</command> e prema o botón <guibutton>Aceptar</"
"guibutton>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding random signatures to &kmail;"
msgstr "Engadir sinaturas aleatorias ao &kmail;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adding a random signature, just like the daily signature, is pretty straight "
"forward. Open &kmail; by pressing <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>F2</keycap></"
"keycombo>. Enter <command>kmail</command> in the text box and then press "
"<guibutton>Run</guibutton>. Once inside &kmail;, go to "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure KMail...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. In the <guilabel>Identities</guilabel> selection, "
"highlight the identity to add the signature to and then press the "
"<guibutton>Modify...</guibutton> button on the right-hand side of the "
"window. Select the <guilabel>Signature</guilabel> tab. Check the "
"<guilabel>Enable signature</guilabel> box. From the <guilabel>Obtain "
"signature text from</guilabel> drop down, select <guimenuitem>Output of "
"Command</guimenuitem>. In the <guilabel>Specify command</guilabel> text box, "
"enter <command>ksig --random</command> and then press the <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Engadir unha sinatura diaria é, como engadir a sinatura diaria, ben sinxelo. "
"Abra o &kmail; con <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo>. Escriba "
"<command>kmail</command> no campo de texto e prema <guibutton>Executar</"
"guibutton>. Unha vez dentro do &kmail;, vaia a "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Configuración</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configurar KMail..."
"</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Na sección <guilabel>Identidades</guilabel> "
"resalte a identidade á que lle quere engadir a sinatura e prema o botón "
"<guibutton>Modificar...</guibutton> que hai na parte dereita da xanela. "
"Seleccione o separador <guilabel>Sinatura</guilabel>. Seleccione a opción "
"<guilabel>Activar a sinatura</guilabel>. No menú despregábel <guilabel>Obter "
"o texto da sinatura de</guilabel> seleccione <guimenuitem>Saída de comando</"
"guimenuitem>. No campo de texto <guilabel>Especificar comando</guilabel> "
"escriba <command>ksig --random</command> e prema o botón <guibutton>Aceptar</"
"guibutton>."

